          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 79.92,
          "end": 82.47,
          "en": "So in the else case I want to show the meetup grid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 83.01,
          "end": 85.28999999999999,
          "en": "And then I close that if check.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 85.59,
          "end": 88.56,
          "en": "Otherwise, I want to show a loading spinner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 88.56,
          "end": 92.13,
